<title>BRAZIL: RESEARCH ALERT-Lojas Arapua begun.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Lojas Arapua begun.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Caspian Securities said in a report it had initiated coverage of Brazilian retailer Lojas Arapua with a buy rating and a 1997 year-end price target of 22 reais per 1,000 shares.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We believe Lojas Arapua shares are undervalued versus its Brazilian and Latin American peers,&quot; said analyst Esther Hiranobe.</p>
<p>-- &quot;With consolidation taking place in the retail market, we believe there is a strong possibility that Lojas Arapua will be able to acquire small or medium-sized retailers, thereby boosting its nationwide expansion program,&quot; she added.</p>
</text>
